  "content": "<h1>即時動作</h1>\n<p><strong>新增開關，讓常見互動更快、更方便。</strong></p>\n<p>可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finstant-actions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/instant-actions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 上獲取。</p>\n<h2>📖 功能</h2>\n<h3>農業</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>雙倍翻土：</strong>翻土一個方塊時，也會同時翻土相鄰的方塊。</li>\n<li><strong>雙倍播種：</strong>種植作物時，也會在同一可種植方塊上的所有相鄰空位種植相同的作物。</li>\n<li><strong>雙倍骨粉：</strong>對作物使用骨粉時，也會對相同類型的相鄰作物施加骨粉效果。</li>\n<li><strong>作物即時成熟：</strong>將作物生長至完全成熟，消耗所需的骨粉數量。</li>\n<li><strong>連鎖採收：</strong>破壞已成熟的作物時，會自動採收半徑3格內所有連接的同類成熟作物。</li>\n<li><strong>堆肥桶即時填滿：</strong>即時填滿堆肥桶，消耗所需的物品數量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>動物</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>即時馴服：</strong>保證第一次嘗試即可馴服成功。</li>\n<li><strong>動物即時成長：</strong>餵養幼年動物可使其立即成長為成年。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>食物</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>即時恢復飢餓值：</strong>食用食物時，會自動消耗足夠數量的該物品以完全恢復飢餓值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📋 使用方法</h2>\n<p>所有開關預設為<strong>關閉</strong>，因此在你啟用所需功能之前，模組不會執行任何操作。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>透過 <strong>Mod Menu（模組選單）</strong> 開啟設定畫面，或在聊天欄輸入 <code>/instant-actions config</code>。</li>\n<li>啟用你希望使用的開關。</li>\n<li>儲存以套用變更。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>💡 範例</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252finstant-actions%252f26.1%252f.github%252fexamples%252fcrops.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/instant-actions/26.1/.github/examples/crops.gif\" alt=\"crops\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252finstant-actions%252f26.1%252f.github%252fexamples%252fharvesting.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/instant-actions/26.1/.github/examples/harvesting.gif\" alt=\"harvesting\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252finstant-actions%252f26.1%252f.github%252fexamples%252fcomposter.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/instant-actions/26.1/.github/examples/composter.gif\" alt=\"composter\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252finstant-actions%252f26.2%252f.github%252fexamples%252fhunger.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/instant-actions/26.2/.github/examples/hunger.gif\" alt=\"hunger\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252finstant-actions%252f26.2%252f.github%252fexamples%252fdouble-seeding.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/instant-actions/26.2/.github/examples/double-seeding.gif\" alt=\"double seeding\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fvictorfaurschou%252finstant-actions%252f26.2%252f.github%252fexamples%252fdouble-tilling.gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/victorfaurschou/instant-actions/26.2/.github/examples/double-tilling.gif\" alt=\"double tilling\"></a></p>\n<p>以及更多…</p>\n<h2>📌 注意事項</h2>\n<p>這是一個<strong>客戶端模組</strong>。它在單人遊戲以及內建伺服器（開放至區域網路）中均可運作。</p>\n<p>每位玩家獨立控制自己的開關。如果你作為世界主機啟用了某個開關，它僅適用於你本人。其他安裝了該模組並加入的玩家，將使用他們各自的開關設定。未安裝該模組的玩家則不受影響。</p>\n<p>如果加入一個主機未安裝此模組但你自己已安裝的世界，該模組將無效，並會顯示警告訊息。</p>\n<p>此模組無法在專用伺服器上運作。</p>\n<h2>🔗 相依性</h2>\n<h3>必要</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>選用</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🏷️ 標籤</h2>\n<p><code>minecraft, mod, fabric, quality of life, qol, instant action, quick action, quick use, instant use, taming, hunger, consume, bone meal, farming, crops, tilling, seeding, harvest, compost, breeding</code></p>",
